From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pavel Khmelinsky <hmepas@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 11:32:11 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 03/14] Keep the selected channel in view in ALL mode

A click on a channel from another team changes the team, and upstream scrolls
the sidebar to the top on that, so the list jumped back to its start. ALL mode
now skips that reset and scrolls instantly to a channel selected by a click or
by search, once per selection, and only if it isn't visible already.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../sidebar_list/sidebar_list.test.tsx        | 64 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../sidebar/sidebar_list/sidebar_list.tsx     | 42 +++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 104 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/webapp/channels/src/components/sidebar/sidebar_list/sidebar_list.test.tsx b/webapp/channels/src/components/sidebar/sidebar_list/sidebar_list.test.tsx
index 8abe4257..c5d8ce4d 100644
--- a/webapp/channels/src/components/sidebar/sidebar_list/sidebar_list.test.tsx
